; The ONE variable: `top_level` in the Node2D world walk. A top-level CanvasItem
; resolves to a null parent item and becomes a canvas root of its own, so its
; transform is canvas space rather than its parent's (canvas_item.cpp:565-571,
; and `_enter_canvas`'s "Resolves to nullptr if the node is top_level").
; `unit-control-top-level.tscn` moves the same flag in the Control walk, which
; is a different walker; no other fixture in the corpus sets it at all. The
; sibling without the flag holds the inherited position beside it.

